---
import { publicImage } from '../lib/config';
export const prerender = true;
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
import LegalStatus from '../components/LegalStatus.astro';
import EntityFaq from '../components/EntityFaq.astro';
---

<Content
  kicker="Company"
  title="About avaTOK"
  description="avaTOK is a creator platform for paid live streaming and 1:1 video sessions — creators publish paid listings, people book or join, and creators get paid."
  image="/og/about.png"
  lead="AvaTOK is a global creator platform from Ava Global International, Inc., a Delaware company founded by American and Indian founders."
  updated="2026-09-15"
>
  <h2 data-i18n="web-about.a336150f3e721c87" id="status">A US company with American and Indian founders</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.b47db0c3cd5c3c93">avaTOK is the platform brand of</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-about.b321f789aa69e114">Ava Global International, Inc.</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.16bea33e579a653f">, a domestic
    Delaware corporation. Our founders are American and Indian, and we are building a global
    platform where people earn money from what they already know and who they already are.</ui-copy>
  </p>
  <LegalStatus variant="full" />

  <figure class="editorial-photo">
    <img data-india-i18n-attr="alt:web-about.c1dc3d3115a3996c" src={publicImage('/genz-friends.jpg', { width: 900, fit: 'scale-down' })} alt="Four friends laughing together over a phone" />
    <figcaption data-i18n="web-about.9a7ca1dcb0b8a00f">Built so a conversation can be worth something to both people in it.</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-about.c53d5fdc209c1b4a">What we're building</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.eee3932ecd37d1bd">avaTOK is a</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-about.e2d3566be3ad82fa">creator platform for paid live streaming and paid 1:1 video sessions</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.9c2e58cd53b756f0">.
    Plenty of people have something others will pay for — a skill, a subject they know cold, advice,
    coaching, company, an hour of real attention. What they usually lack is the boring machinery
    around it: a way to price it, a place to be found, a calendar, and a way to actually get paid.
    That machinery is the product.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-about.9c870aa6e5e93270">How it works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong data-i18n="web-about.c79947b59da2e144">A creator publishes a listing.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.6fc6c918b70282a7">They choose a category, describe what they
      offer, and set their price in Tokens at the fixed Indian-rupee value of ₹1 per Token. Listing
      is free.</ui-copy>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong data-i18n="web-about.c91fdf4dcdc47879">People browse and book.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.f9d7d792bc1d8f04">A viewer joins a paid live event, or books a private
      1:1 video session in a slot the creator has opened on their calendar.</ui-copy>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong data-i18n="web-about.6705147cdac29b0e">The session happens on avaTOK.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.e6bd3251508b3285">Live streams and 1:1 sessions both run inside
      the platform, so nobody has to swap phone numbers or move to another app.</ui-copy>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong data-i18n="web-about.994eef80a799f362">The creator gets paid.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.b7fb0b11c336be13">Earnings are recorded in their avaTOK wallet. Withdrawal
      semantics are not yet available; see</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-about.aba115e7791e41dc" href="/payouts">Payouts &amp; Withdrawals</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.44ef0f56b9979a9a">for status.</ui-copy>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-about.fae81e8811b5b2cc">Categories, not one narrow niche</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.43665a2a3873c882">Creators list across a range of categories — teaching and tutoring, coaching and advice,
    consultations, performance and entertainment, wellness and conversation. What they have in
    common is that the thing being sold is</ui-copy> <em data-i18n="web-about.a539875c81f0be05">time and attention</em><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.0e15ad03ba71cd06">, live, from one person to
    another. Browse what is live now on the</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-about.dfd76b3ecbefe460" href="/marketplace">marketplace</a>.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-about.5cf0a207bf55a00f">
    Messaging, a masked avaTOK number that keeps a creator's real phone number private, and AI
    tooling exist to support that — they are how a booking gets arranged safely, not the product
    itself.
  </p>
  <div class="note">
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.d3170d80a7227a2b">A note on AI: our products use artificial intelligence, and AI can make mistakes. We share more
    in our</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-about.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.78f09b8ec92fc38f">. We've also made our best efforts to use
    AI-generated imagery responsibly — if you ever find something objectionable, email</ui-copy>
    <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.3c64655764e439e9">and we'll remove it. It was never
    intentional.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-about.00fe05aa04124fd0">What we value</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-about.0b46eaaa4d5b0926">Creators get paid.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.b8936763ee3d8c33">The price is set by the creator, shown before anyone
      commits, and the earnings are theirs minus a stated platform fee. No surprises in either
      direction — see</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-about.5e2a4b33bff1936b" href="/pricing-fees">Pricing &amp; Fees</a>.</li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-about.4584fbc58966f8d4">Privacy by default.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.99941752cf36d2be">A creator publishes a listing, not a phone number. Your
      real number stays masked behind an avaTOK number.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-about.e61a3fd80d28013b">Say what is true.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.fafc45e9991ecace">We are early, payments may be limited during rollout,
      and we say so clearly rather than burying it.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-about.7b1bf0fcc27f2b8d">Built responsibly.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.2b181508355e13ae">Consent for recording, safety rules that apply to both
      sides of a session, and honest AI are part of the product, not an afterthought.</ui-copy></li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-about.1346afbfe47d58f8">American and Indian founders, built for the world</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.b8687f1951cfa76a">avaTOK is made with care by American and Indian founders for creators and audiences around the
    world. Want to help build it? See our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-about.d3e2d74eba4633de" href="/careers">open roles</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.53622fe080837dfb">. If you are an investor who wants to back an early global
    creator platform, we would like to hear from you —</ui-copy>
    <a href="mailto:hello@avatok.ai">hello@avatok.ai</a>.
  </p>

  {/* [WEB-SEO-6] Entity definition + FAQPage — see the component header. */}
  <EntityFaq />

  <h2 data-i18n="web-about.79ec38d5416d6bda" id="press">Press & media</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.47fa691475e21506">For press, partnership, or media inquiries, reach us at</ui-copy>
    <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.af9dca172b91ee9f">and we'll get back to you. You can also
    read the latest from our team on the</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-about.53e733442d307889" href="/blog">avaTOK blog</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-about.115e410f01dc4013">Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.5c944e8592e2d7b3">Questions, ideas, or feedback? We'd love to hear from you — visit our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-about.5d1fabafc7eb451a" href="/contact">contact page</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-about.207c51302b345971">or email</ui-copy> <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a>.
  </p>
</Content>
